Phi_k is the union of the following contributing sets: 
 (i) union_{T_i in tau_P_k} {j*p_i + d_i | j in N_greater_equal_0} 
 (ii) union_{T_i in tau \ tau_P_k} {j*p_i + d_i | j in N_greater_equal_1} 
 (iii) union_{T_i in tau_P_k} {j*p_i | j in N_greater_equal_1}

